  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| webdriverio | devDependencies | patch | [`5.7.2` -> `5.7.3`](https://diff.intrinsic.com/webdriverio/5.7.2/5.7.3) | [homepage](https://webdriver.io), [source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>webdriverio/webdriverio</summary>\n\n### [`v5.7.3`](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;573-2019-03-17)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/compare/v5.7.2...v5.7.3)\n\n##### :eyeglasses: Spec Compliancy\n\n-   `webdriver`\n    -   [#&#8203;3733](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3733) Fixing press key code type to number ([@&#8203;Gilad-Shnoor](https://togithub.com/Gilad-Shnoor))\n\n##### :nail_care: Polish\n\n-   `webdriverio`\n    -   [#&#8203;3716](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3716) webdriverio: Allow selectByVisibleText to work with newlines ([@&#8203;WillBrock](https://togithub.com/WillBrock))\n\n##### :memo: Documentation\n\n-   [#&#8203;3731](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3731) Typo fix ([@&#8203;jume-dev](https://togithub.com/jume-dev))\n-   [#&#8203;3730](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3730) Fixed typo ([@&#8203;venkatshukla](https://togithub.com/venkatshukla))\n-   [#&#8203;3723](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3723) docs: Update custom reporter example ([@&#8203;WillBrock](https://togithub.com/WillBrock))\n-   [#&#8203;3712](https://togithub.com/webdriverio/webdriverio/pull/3712) edits to mobile selectors section ([@&#8203;marckassay](https://togithub.com/marckassay))\n\n##### Committers: 5\n\n-   Marc Kassay ([@&#8203;marckassay](https://togithub.com/marckassay))\n-   Robert Kranz ([@&#8203;jume-dev](https://togithub.com/jume-dev))\n-   Will Brock ([@&#8203;WillBrock](https://togithub.com/WillBrock))\n-   [@&#8203;Gilad-Shnoor](https://togithub.com/Gilad-Shnoor)\n-   [@&#8203;venkatshukla](https://togithub.com/venkatshukla)\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
